    <p>The Office of Student Services (CLAS) handles all matters (besides Thesis submissions) relating to the Master of Arts degree, including but not limited to: Plans of Work, Changes in Plans of Work, Graduate Transfer Credit Forms, Changes of Status (required to change from PhD to Masters or vice versa, to add a 2nd program, or to change from one grad program to another within the college as well as other programs); Time Extensions, Credit Revalidations, Graduation Applications, and Masters Essay submissions for Plan B students.</p>
